  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plant-based Indian medicinal foods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A pilot intervention on existing collaborations and deploys digital reference resources from partners to document both nutritional and medicinal uses, cross-reference these to health references, harmonise their terminologies and publish through existing institutional portals. Detailed nutritional analysis of 50 widely-used products to support TDU&#x2019;s community-health programme, inform regional policies and improve global regulation of these products via Kew&#x2019;s partners (e.g. WHO, WIPO and ISO).</narrative>
  </description>
